Totus asked about brandy, so I ran a bunch of words through jvocuhadju. One of 
them came out with a score of 13016 for "feblunsyvanju" with the -l option, 
and 13086 for "febylusyvanju" without the -l option. This reminded me of 
another word, "ricpurdyxrula", which appeared in a translation of a Sally 
Rogers song, which I never finished. The scores are different, 12996 vs. 
13066, but the difference is the same.

